   (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   It is a collection of descriptions of real public places. It is offered
   with no warranty of accuracy and is not safety advice. See NOTICE.

2. The fonts in public/fonts/ are licensed under the SIL Open Font License
   version 1.1 by their respective authors, not by the copyright holder above.
   The licence text for each family sits beside the files it covers; see
   public/fonts/README.md.

3. The globe geometry in public/globe-*.bin is derived from Natural Earth via
   the world-atlas package. Natural Earth is public domain. See NOTICE.
